.TH MORE 1 "Riplix" "Ripple"
.SH NAME
more \- display text a page at a time
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
more [file ...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display files, or standard input when no file is named. Space shows
another page, Enter shows one more line, n selects the next file, and q
quits. Ctrl-C interrupts and returns to the shell. Terminal settings are
restored when the pager exits.
.PP
With redirected output, more copies the input unchanged. LINES and COLUMNS
can override the terminal size.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
more README
seq 1 100 | more
.fi
